---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout>
  <!-- Main Header -->
  <header class="border-b border-zinc-800/80 bg-zinc-950/70 backdrop-blur-xl sticky top-0 z-40 transition-all">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 h-16 flex items-center justify-between">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
        <div class="h-9 w-9 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-tr from-emerald-600 via-emerald-500 to-teal-400 flex items-center justify-center shadow-lg shadow-emerald-500/20 ring-1 ring-emerald-400/30">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-zinc-950 stroke-[2.5]" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="font-extrabold text-lg tracking-tight bg-gradient-to-r from-white via-zinc-100 to-zinc-400 bg-clip-text text-transparent">
              TokenDiet
            </span>
            <span class="px-2 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-semibold tracking-wide uppercase bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-400 border border-emerald-500/20 rounded-full">
              100% Client-Side
            </span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-zinc-400 hidden sm:block">
            Minificador semántico de código para ChatGPT, Claude y Gemini
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Action items in header -->
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 sm:gap-3">
        <!-- Botón de Sponsor / Buy Me a Coffee -->
        <a
          href="https://buymeacoffee.com/gregor20"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          aria-label="Apoyar el proyecto con un café o sponsor"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-medium text-amber-300/90 hover:text-amber-200 bg-amber-500/10 hover:bg-amber-500/15 border border-amber-500/25 hover:border-amber-500/40 rounded-lg transition-all shadow-sm shadow-amber-500/5 group"
        >
          <span class="group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform">☕</span>
          <span class="hidden sm:inline">Buy me a coffee</span>
          <span class="sm:hidden">Sponsor</span>
        </a>

        <button
          id="btn-sample"
          type="button"
          aria-label="Cargar código de ejemplo"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-medium text-zinc-300 hover:text-white bg-zinc-900/90 hover:bg-zinc-800 border border-zinc-700/60 rounded-lg transition-colors cursor-pointer"
        >
          <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-zinc-400" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19.5 14.25v-2.625a3.375 3.375 0 0 0-3.375-3.375h-1.5A1.125 1.125 0 0 1 13.5 7.125v-1.5a3.375 3.375 0 0 0-3.375-3.375H8.25m0 12.75h7.5m-7.5 3H12M10.5 2.25H5.625c-.621 0-1.125.504-1.125 1.125v17.25c0 .621.504 1.125 1.125 1.125h12.75c.621 0 1.125-.504 1.125-1.125V11.25a9 9 0 0 0-9-9Z" />
          </svg>
          <span>Ejemplo</span>
        </button>

        <button
          id="btn-clear"
          type="button"
          aria-label="Limpiar todo el contenido"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1.5 text-xs font-medium text-zinc-400 hover:text-rose-400 bg-zinc-900/60 hover:bg-zinc-900 border border-zinc-800 hover:border-rose-900/40 rounded-lg transition-colors cursor-pointer"
        >
          <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="m14.74 9-.346 9m-4.788 0L9.26 9m9.968-3.21c.342.052.682.107 1.022.166m-1.022-.165L18.16 19.673a2.25 2.25 0 0 1-2.244 2.077H8.084a2.25 2.25 0 0 1-2.244-2.077L4.772 5.79m14.456 0a48.108 48.108 0 0 0-3.478-.397m-12 .562c.34-.059.68-.114 1.022-.165m0 0a48.11 48.11 0 0 1 3.478-.397m7.5 0v-.916c0-1.18-.91-2.164-2.09-2.201a51.964 51.964 0 0 0-3.32 0c-1.18.037-2.09 1.022-2.09 2.201v.916m7.5 0a48.667 48.667 0 0 0-7.5 0" />
          </svg>
          <span class="hidden sm:inline">Limpiar</span>
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <!-- Main Content Container -->
  <main class="flex-1 max-w-7xl w-full mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-6 space-y-6">
    
    <!-- Hero & Description -->
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto pt-2 pb-1">
      <h1 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white">
        Reduce tus costos de API de IA <span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-emerald-400 via-teal-300 to-cyan-400 bg-clip-text text-transparent">minificando tu código</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm sm:text-base text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed">
        Elimina comentarios, indentaciones innecesarias y espacios en blanco sin romper la semántica de tu código. Ejecución 100% en tu navegador: tus fuentes nunca salen de tu equipo.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- METRICS DASHBOARD -->
    <section aria-label="Métricas de reducción de tokens" class="grid grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-3 sm:gap-4">
      <!-- Original Tokens Card -->
      <div class="bg-zinc-900/60 border border-zinc-800/80 rounded-2xl p-4 relative overflow-hidden backdrop-blur-sm group hover:border-zinc-700/80 transition-all">
        <div class="text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-wider text-zinc-400 flex items-center justify-between">
          <span>Tokens Originales</span>
          <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-zinc-600"></span>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-2 flex items-baseline gap-2">
          <span id="stat-original-tokens" class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold font-mono text-zinc-200">0</span>
          <span class="text-xs text-zinc-500 font-mono">tokens</span>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-1 text-xs text-zinc-500 flex items-center gap-1">
          <span id="stat-original-chars">0</span> caracteres
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Optimized Tokens Card -->
      <div class="bg-zinc-900/60 border border-zinc-800/80 rounded-2xl p-4 relative overflow-hidden backdrop-blur-sm group hover:border-zinc-700/80 transition-all">
        <div class="text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-wider text-zinc-400 flex items-center justify-between">
          <span>Tokens Optimizados</span>
          <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-teal-500"></span>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-2 flex items-baseline gap-2">
          <span id="stat-minified-tokens" class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold font-mono text-teal-300">0</span>
          <span class="text-xs text-teal-500/70 font-mono">tokens</span>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-1 text-xs text-zinc-500 flex items-center gap-1">
          <span id="stat-minified-chars">0</span> caracteres
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Reduction Percentage Card -->
      <div class="bg-gradient-to-b from-emerald-950/20 to-zinc-900/80 border border-emerald-500/30 rounded-2xl p-4 relative overflow-hidden backdrop-blur-sm group hover:border-emerald-500/50 transition-all shadow-lg shadow-emerald-950/20">
        <div class="absolute -right-6 -bottom-6 w-20 h-20 bg-emerald-500/10 rounded-full blur-xl pointer-events-none"></div>
        <div class="text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-wider text-emerald-400 flex items-center justify-between">
          <span>Reducción Lograda</span>
          <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-400 animate-pulse"></span>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-2 flex items-baseline gap-2">
          <span id="stat-reduction-pct" class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold font-mono text-emerald-400">0%</span>
          <span id="stat-tokens-saved" class="text-xs text-emerald-300/80 font-mono">(-0 tkn)</span>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-1 text-xs text-emerald-400/80 font-medium flex items-center gap-1">
          Consumo optimizado
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Estimated Money Saved Card -->
      <div class="bg-gradient-to-b from-emerald-950/30 to-zinc-900/80 border border-emerald-500/40 rounded-2xl p-4 relative overflow-hidden backdrop-blur-sm group hover:border-emerald-500/60 transition-all shadow-lg shadow-emerald-950/30">
        <div class="text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-wider text-emerald-300 flex items-center justify-between">
          <span>Ahorro Estimado</span>
          <span class="text-[10px] font-mono px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-300">$5/1M</span>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-2 flex items-baseline gap-1">
          <span class="text-lg font-mono text-emerald-400">$</span>
          <span id="stat-saved-dollars" class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold font-mono text-emerald-300">0.0000</span>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-1 text-xs text-zinc-400 flex items-center gap-1">
          <span class="text-emerald-400/90 font-medium">x1,000 reqs:</span>
          <span id="stat-saved-projection" class="font-mono text-emerald-300 font-semibold">$0.00</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ========================================================================= -->
    <!-- CONTENEDOR DE MONETIZACIÓN (AFILIADOS DÍA 1 / CARBON ADS FUTURO)           -->
    <!-- Para migrar a Carbon Ads en el futuro: reemplaza el bloque <a> inferior    -->
    <!-- por tu script: <script async src="//cdn.carbonads.com/carbon.js?..."></script>-->
    <!-- ========================================================================= -->
    <div id="monetization-slot" class="w-full">
      <a
        href="https://m.do.co/c/51fb82b44217"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener sponsored"
        class="group relative flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-center justify-between gap-3 p-3.5 sm:px-5 sm:py-3 rounded-xl bg-zinc-900/80 hover:bg-zinc-800/80 border border-zinc-800/90 hover:border-zinc-700/80 transition-all shadow-sm hover:shadow-md cursor-pointer ring-1 ring-white/5"
      >
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3.5 min-w-0">
          <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-blue-500/15 border border-blue-500/30 text-blue-400 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 text-base shadow-sm">
            🚀
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-zinc-300 leading-snug">
            <strong class="font-semibold text-zinc-100">¿Desarrollando con IA?</strong>
            <span class="text-zinc-400"> Obtén $200 en créditos gratuitos para desplegar tus modelos en DigitalOcean.</span>
            <span class="text-emerald-400 font-medium group-hover:underline inline-flex items-center gap-1 ml-1">
              Reclama tu crédito aquí
              <svg class="w-3 h-3 group-hover:translate-x-0.5 transition-transform" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13.5 4.5L21 12m0 0l-7.5 7.5M21 12H3" />
              </svg>
            </span>
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="self-end sm:self-center shrink-0">
          <span class="text-[10px] font-mono tracking-wider uppercase px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-zinc-800/90 text-zinc-400 border border-zinc-700/50">
            Patrocinado
          </span>
        </div>
      </a>
    </div>

    <!-- CONTROLS & LANGUAGE SELECTOR BAR -->
    <section class="bg-zinc-900/50 border border-zinc-800/70 rounded-xl p-3 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 text-xs">
      <!-- Language Buttons -->
      <div class="flex items-center gap-1 flex-wrap">
        <span class="text-zinc-400 font-medium mr-1.5 flex items-center gap-1">
          <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-zinc-500" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M10.5 21l5.25-11.25L21 21m-9-3h7.5M3 5.621a48.474 48.474 0 0 1 6-.371m0 0c1.12 0 2.233.038 3.334.114M9 5.25V3m3.334 2.364C11.176 10.658 7.69 15.08 3 17.502m9.334-12.138c.896.061 1.785.147 2.666.257m-4.59-1.428A48.567 48.567 0 0 1 12 3" />
          </svg>
          Sintaxis:
        </span>
        <button type="button" data-lang="auto" class="lang-btn active px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md font-medium transition-all bg-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-300 border border-emerald-500/30">Auto</button>
        <button type="button" data-lang="javascript" class="lang-btn px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md font-medium text-zinc-400 hover:text-zinc-200 hover:bg-zinc-800/60 transition-all border border-transparent">JS / TS</button>
        <button type="button" data-lang="python" class="lang-btn px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md font-medium text-zinc-400 hover:text-zinc-200 hover:bg-zinc-800/60 transition-all border border-transparent">Python</button>
        <button type="button" data-lang="json" class="lang-btn px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md font-medium text-zinc-400 hover:text-zinc-200 hover:bg-zinc-800/60 transition-all border border-transparent">JSON</button>
        <button type="button" data-lang="html" class="lang-btn px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md font-medium text-zinc-400 hover:text-zinc-200 hover:bg-zinc-800/60 transition-all border border-transparent">HTML</button>
        <span id="detected-badge" class="ml-1 text-[11px] font-mono px-2 py-0.5 bg-zinc-800 text-zinc-400 rounded border border-zinc-700/50">detectado: auto</span>
      </div>

      <!-- Quick Toggles -->
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 flex-wrap">
        <label class="flex items-center gap-1.5 cursor-pointer text-zinc-300 hover:text-white select-none">
          <input type="checkbox" id="opt-comments" checked class="w-3.5 h-3.5 rounded bg-zinc-950 border-zinc-700 text-emerald-500 focus:ring-0 focus:ring-offset-0 cursor-pointer accent-emerald-500" />
          <span>Comentarios</span>
        </label>
        <label class="flex items-center gap-1.5 cursor-pointer text-zinc-300 hover:text-white select-none">
          <input type="checkbox" id="opt-whitespace" checked class="w-3.5 h-3.5 rounded bg-zinc-950 border-zinc-700 text-emerald-500 focus:ring-0 focus:ring-offset-0 cursor-pointer accent-emerald-500" />
          <span>Espacios/Sangrías</span>
        </label>
        <label class="flex items-center gap-1.5 cursor-pointer text-zinc-300 hover:text-white select-none">
          <input type="checkbox" id="opt-blanklines" checked class="w-3.5 h-3.5 rounded bg-zinc-950 border-zinc-700 text-emerald-500 focus:ring-0 focus:ring-offset-0 cursor-pointer accent-emerald-500" />
          <span>Líneas Vacías</span>
        </label>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- TWO MAIN EDITOR PANELS -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-4 lg:gap-6 min-h-[520px]">
      
      <!-- LEFT PANEL: ORIGINAL CODE -->
      <div class="flex flex-col bg-zinc-950/90 border border-zinc-800/90 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl ring-1 ring-white/5 focus-within:border-zinc-700 transition-all">
        <!-- Panel Header -->
        <div class="px-4 py-3 bg-zinc-900/70 border-b border-zinc-800/80 flex items-center justify-between gap-2">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-zinc-600"></span>
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-zinc-200 tracking-wide uppercase">Código Original</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <button
              id="btn-paste"
              type="button"
              aria-label="Pegar código del portapapeles"
              class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 px-2.5 py-1 text-[11px] font-medium text-zinc-400 hover:text-zinc-200 bg-zinc-800/70 hover:bg-zinc-800 border border-zinc-700/50 rounded-md transition-colors cursor-pointer"
            >
              <svg class="w-3 h-3" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M15.666 3.888A2.25 2.25 0 0 0 13.5 2.25h-3c-1.03 0-1.9.693-2.166 1.638m7.332 0c.055.194.084.4.084.612v0a.75.75 0 0 1-.75.75H9a.75.75 0 0 1-.75-.75v0c0-.212.03-.418.084-.612m7.332 0c.646.049 1.288.11 1.927.184 1.1.128 1.907 1.077 1.907 2.185V19.5a2.25 2.25 0 0 1-2.25 2.25H6.75A2.25 2.25 0 0 1 4.5 19.5V6.257c0-1.108.806-2.057 1.907-2.185a48.208 48.208 0 0 1 1.927-.184" />
              </svg>
              <span>Pegar</span>
            </button>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Textarea Editor -->
        <div class="relative flex-1 flex flex-col p-2">
          <textarea
            id="input-code"
            aria-label="Área de texto para el código original a minificar"
            placeholder="// Pega aquí tu código JavaScript, TypeScript, Python, JSON o HTML...
// Por ejemplo:
function calculateDiscount(price, user) {
    // Si el usuario es VIP, aplica 20%
    if (user.isVIP) {
        return price * 0.80;
    }
    return price;
}"
            class="flex-1 w-full min-h-[380px] p-3.5 bg-transparent text-zinc-200 placeholder:text-zinc-600 font-mono text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed resize-none focus:outline-none focus:ring-0 border-0"
            spellcheck="false"
          ></textarea>
        </div>

        <!-- Panel Footer -->
        <div class="px-4 py-2 bg-zinc-900/40 border-t border-zinc-800/60 text-[11px] text-zinc-500 font-mono flex items-center justify-between">
          <span id="left-lines-count">0 líneas</span>
          <span id="left-chars-count">0 caracteres</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- RIGHT PANEL: OPTIMIZED CODE -->
      <div class="flex flex-col bg-zinc-950/90 border border-emerald-500/30 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl shadow-emerald-950/10 ring-1 ring-emerald-500/10 transition-all">
        <!-- Panel Header -->
        <div class="px-4 py-3 bg-zinc-900/70 border-b border-zinc-800/80 flex items-center justify-between gap-2">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-400"></span>
            <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-400 tracking-wide uppercase">Código Optimizado para IA</span>
          </div>

          <!-- Prominent Copy Button -->
          <button
            id="btn-copy"
            type="button"
            aria-label="Copiar código optimizado al portapapeles"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3.5 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold text-zinc-950 bg-gradient-to-r from-emerald-400 to-teal-300 hover:from-emerald-300 hover:to-teal-200 rounded-lg shadow-md shadow-emerald-500/20 active:scale-95 transition-all cursor-pointer ring-1 ring-emerald-400/40"
          >
            <svg id="copy-icon" class="w-3.5 h-3.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M8.25 7.5V6.108c0-1.135.845-2.098 1.976-2.192.373-.03.748-.057 1.124-.08M15.75 18H18a2.25 2.25 0 0 0 2.25-2.25V6.108c0-1.135-.845-2.098-1.976-2.192a48.424 48.424 0 0 0-1.123-.08M15.75 18.75v-1.875a3.375 3.375 0 0 0-3.375-3.375h-1.5a1.125 1.125 0 0 1-1.125-1.125v-1.5A3.375 3.375 0 0 0 6.375 7.5H5.25m10.5 11.25H6.75A2.25 2.25 0 0 1 4.5 16.5V7.5" />
            </svg>
            <span id="copy-text">Copiar Código Optimizado</span>
          </button>
        </div>

        <!-- Output View -->
        <div class="relative flex-1 flex flex-col p-2 bg-zinc-950/40">
          <textarea
            id="output-code"
            readonly
            aria-label="Código optimizado resultante listo para ser copiado"
            placeholder="El código optimizado sin comentarios ni espacios innecesarios aparecerá aquí..."
            class="flex-1 w-full min-h-[380px] p-3.5 bg-transparent text-emerald-200/90 placeholder:text-zinc-600 font-mono text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed resize-none focus:outline-none focus:ring-0 border-0 select-all"
            spellcheck="false"
          ></textarea>
        </div>

        <!-- Panel Footer -->
        <div class="px-4 py-2 bg-zinc-900/40 border-t border-zinc-800/60 text-[11px] text-zinc-400 font-mono flex items-center justify-between">
          <span id="right-lines-count">0 líneas</span>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <span id="right-tokens-badge" class="text-emerald-400 font-medium">0 tokens</span>
            <span class="text-zinc-600">|</span>
            <span id="right-chars-count">0 caracteres</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- BENEFIT INFORMATION CARDS -->
    <section class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4 pt-4 text-xs text-zinc-400">
      <div class="p-4 rounded-xl border border-zinc-800/60 bg-zinc-900/30">
        <div class="font-semibold text-zinc-200 mb-1 flex items-center gap-1.5">
          <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-400"></span>
          ¿Por qué reducir tokens de código?
        </div>
        <p>Los modelos de IA procesan cada carácter de indentación y comentario como tokens costosos. Reducirlos permite enviar prompts más largos sin saturar la ventana de contexto.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="p-4 rounded-xl border border-zinc-800/60 bg-zinc-900/30">
        <div class="font-semibold text-zinc-200 mb-1 flex items-center gap-1.5">
          <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-teal-400"></span>
          Privacidad y Seguridad 100% Local
        </div>
        <p>Todo el procesamiento se ejecuta estrictamente en tu navegador usando Vanilla JavaScript. Ningún fragmento de código se envía a servidores externos ni se almacena.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="p-4 rounded-xl border border-zinc-800/60 bg-zinc-900/30">
        <div class="font-semibold text-zinc-200 mb-1 flex items-center gap-1.5">
          <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-cyan-400"></span>
          Ahorro Real en Facturas de API
        </div>
        <p>Calculado sobre un costo de referencia de $5.00 por millón de tokens en modelos frontier. Al ahorrar un 30-50% en cada prompt, reduces directamente la factura mensual.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

  </main>

  <!-- Footer -->
  <footer class="mt-auto border-t border-zinc-800/70 py-6 text-center text-xs text-zinc-500">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-3">
